# Production build uses same-origin (VITE_API_BASE unset => '').
# - GitHub Pages: serves the static storefront; menu falls back to the
#   baked-in static food list (no live API, no orders from remote customers).
# - Django same-origin (http://<IP>:8000/): SPA + /api live on one origin so
#   login, orders and the live menu work for customers on the restaurant LAN.
# To enable remote orders later, set VITE_API_BASE to a public HTTPS backend URL.
